La pasé bien, ¿sabés?

62
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:44,620
Toma.

63
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:49,120
- Bueno, gracias.
- ¿En serio?

64
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,320
Llámame, íbamos al cine.

65
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:53,640
Bueno.

66
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,380
Daniela.

67
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:58,460


68
00:05:24,540 --> 00:05:28,040
Ay, qué linda nenita, por favor.

69
00:05:29,930 --> 00:05:31,460
Me siento mal.

70
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:34,860
No sé lo que me pasa, me siento muy mal.

71
00:05:36,100 --> 00:05:38,100
En serio, escúchame.

72
00:05:39,340 --> 00:05:40,360
Me siento mal.

73
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:45,120
Me siento mal.

74
00:05:46,580 --> 00:05:48,100
Daniela, dale, dale.

75
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:50,640
Nena.

76
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,060
Nena.

77
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:57,420
Nena.

78
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,900
Daniela, ¿qué pasa, nena?

79
00:06:06,740 --> 00:06:07,600
¿Qué?

80
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,620
¿Tú veías por acá, Miseritzky?

81
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,120
¿Te pasa algo?

82
00:06:40,780 --> 00:06:41,380
No.

83
00:06:45,220 --> 00:06:46,260
¿Seguro?

84
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:53,440
Doctor Dumas, necesito pedirle un favor.

85
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:57,734
De repente empezó a
tener convulsiones, se

86
00:06:57,746 --> 00:06:59,880
